@startuml

hide footbox
autonumber
title US021 - To get the list of items on direct sale of a given genre

actor Buyer

' Participants
participant ":System" as System

' Interactions

Buyer -> System : I want to get the list of items on direct sale of a given genre
activate System
Buyer <-- System : Which genre? Choose!
deactivate System
Buyer -> System : selectedgenre
activate System
System --> Buyer : Shows the list of items on direct sale
deactivate System

@enduml